1. GOTO url: "https://www.sarwa.co/login"
2. NOTE Stop and let the user log in and complete any reCAPTCHA or OTP challenge. Never enter or capture credentials. Continue only after the user confirms authentication.
3. ASSERT condition: "authenticated Sarwa dashboard visible at /dashboard/account/<account-number>"
4. NOTE Values are reported in USD. Do not record full account numbers in the project capture; retain only a user-approved account label or last four digits.
